 "source": "Graph Coloring Instances page of M. Trick (https://mat.tepper.cmu.edu/COLOR/instances.html), the DIMACS challenge graphs: the instances in the DIMACS text format (.col) for which the page prints a number under 'optimal coloring' and at most 500 vertices",
